    "author": "AppPress",
    "description": "Protect your AppPress site with automated database and file backups \u2014 scheduled or on-demand, stored locally or on S3-compatible storage, optionally AES-256 encrypted, with retention policies, integrity verification, and one-click restore. Implements StandardContracts::BACKUP so App Packs and workflows can trigger backups without direct coupling. Not a content JSON export \u2014 use core export for site migration; use this plugin for disaster recovery.",
